From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BouBou <69978359+BouBouw@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rustic: client menu helpers, languages and the server list

Client helpers for a mod with menus of its own over the title: languages() and
set_language(code) as the Language screen's Done, server_list() (servers.dat, the
hidden entries being the servers joined by address), join_server(address) as Join
Server (the address kept among the hidden servers as Direct Connection does) and
add_server(name, address) as Add Server's Done. What needs the event loop or a
mutable game is queued and run in idle. Rustic ADR 0013, U16.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
